+ * assigned to the first <slot> in the shadow tree whose name is its slot
+ * attribute (text, and elements without one, to the default slot). A real
+ * <slot>'s prototype chain here is the bridge's, not HTMLSlotElement's, so
+ * the methods go on every element prototype (a non-slot answers []).
+ * Not here: slotchange events. */
